Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:14.04,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's nice to be young.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:22.47,Alternative,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:01:59.57,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Now passing through Geschtam Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.57,0:02:02.80,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Estimated arrival at Balun is tam 07:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:06.02,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Linking to system satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:43.83,Announcement,,0,0,0,,120 seconds until warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:49.59,Announcement,,0,0,0,,30 seconds until warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:59.33,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Countdown to warp: 10, 9, 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.35,0:17:05.65,Announcement,,0,0,0,,7, 6, 5, 4, 3, 2...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We were fortunate that Domel brought the UX01.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If the hound's net snares its prey, we'll do it at the Aquarius Ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that be acceptable, Mirenel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Balk.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.31,0:02:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last one. They're all deployed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know? I thought we were getting supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, they have us distributing these weird things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.51,0:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't cargo haulers. We're warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.63,0:02:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Our next mission comes directly from Lord Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:03:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what of the Yamato? We're leaving Domel's command?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.85,0:03:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... The vixen will handle the Yamato personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing on hyperspace sonar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a ripple at the dimensional boundary line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like that ship isn't lying in wait along the Yamato's course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The Milky Way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.59,0:03:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our Earth is somewhere within that flood of light.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And our destination, Iscandar, lies in the Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.77,0:03:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.85,0:03:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a good chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to let me pilot for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.19,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our patrol's over, so why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.32,0:04:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have so many of these. We can afford to lose one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.91,0:04:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lt. Kodai, as Operations Officer,\NI order you to transfer control to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As Tactical Officer, I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your authority as Tactical Officer is suspended due to what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.51,0:04:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bringing that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.84,0:04:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,003, this is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.26,0:04:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt, but we can hear everything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,XO, why did you pick those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.27,0:04:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lt. Mort's expertise makes her ideal\Nto test the prototype hyperspace sonar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And with his normal authority rescinded, Lt. Kodai has nothing better to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.83,0:04:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A song? Someone's sing{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Aihara? Come in, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.51,0:05:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yamato!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.69,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.54,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Returning to base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't access the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm retaking control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.65,0:06:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,SID, maintain synchronization with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.86,0:06:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.49,0:06:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.57,0:06:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll use the emergency airlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.45,0:06:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzer...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The momentum control system still appears to be on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Course correction confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No good... I can't access it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the ship's moving, that means the nav system is working.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.50,0:07:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The only places we can access it are the central computer room...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the automatic navigation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is happening on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But what could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.23,0:08:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The power's back, but the elevator isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And the emergency stairs are locked, so we can't reach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai? Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The central computer room and automatic navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.79,0:09:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we split up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.25,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's too risky in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.42,0:09:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.61,0:09:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone was worried. Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's Mamoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back on Earth, right? I'm sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.38,0:10:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole Kodai family is here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, Mom... And my uncles, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible. They all died that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Susumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.93,0:10:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Aren't you going to answer the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.03,0:10:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Susumu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:10:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.25,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you die, Mamoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.71,0:11:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.05,0:11:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't where you belong. Come back, Susumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.39,0:11:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't the kind of person who should be fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.65,0:11:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big brother is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back home together, Susumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.80,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back? To where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,To fight? Against whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:11:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Against whom? Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it I was fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.57,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Hijikata?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In the twentieth century,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,it was normal for families to gather around tables like this for meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.71,0:12:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you will learn about Earth, and you will live as an Earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.47,0:12:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce your partner. This is she.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The central hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't move yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.37,0:13:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.17,0:13:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You hit your head hard. You probably have amnesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...Yuki Mori, caught in the explosion, was taken to the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,where she is still in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Police are also investigating the possibility of terrorism.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,An air raid warning has been issued!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,An air raid warning{\fscx75}—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu, you're a man. Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.76,0:14:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad gave me this a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You take this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No way... This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.53,0:15:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.71,0:15:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.05,0:15:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Misaki? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship is moving. It has a Wave Motion Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke up and found myself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Planet bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.37,0:15:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Susumu, don't forget this sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No good, the course information is locked here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we warping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.51,0:16:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for you there. They're waiting for this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.14,0:16:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship has a Wave Motion Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.19,0:16:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you remove the Wave Motion Core, it will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Engine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. My sister is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom... Jiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't hold back, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Operations Officer Mori's access authorized.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Disconnect of Wave Motion Core\Nsystem's primary connection initiated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Multidimensional momentum-conservation of quantum flywheel complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Power capacitors fully charged.\NPower bus connections severed at all phases.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploying Wave Motion Shield in core conduit bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Shield deployment confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Core may be safely removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, put that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:18:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an order. Put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, Earth will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroyed? The Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your home, which you love so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My home...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now... Bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.02,0:18:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe his ship's delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't here that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the space port to pick up my brother, but then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It fell on my city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Earth is at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.84,0:18:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a war...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is Garmillas. And a planet bomb landed here...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And everyone died!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl... Just put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A Geschtam Field!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing Wave Motion Field in conduit bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.10,0:19:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please evacuate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Restarting Wave Motion Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.25,0:20:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost Link severed. Special Operations Officer Linke's mind isn't returning to her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Transferred data has been saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm all alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ruins were left by the race that built the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a rumor that she is one of their descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:21:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she come here to accomplish, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt any normal man could understand a witch's motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Both that annoying wolf and the vixen are now fixated on the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.52,0:21:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Sado says everyone saw\Nwhatever memory they most cherish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw my mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.68,0:21:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw someone I cared about, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.23,0:21:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, you came for me, didn't you Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.69,0:21:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Mori...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.03,0:22:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.86,0:22:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.99,0:22:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuria Misaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In the vast space between galaxies,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.83,0:25:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a trap is laid by a patient enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.58,0:25:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,With hell ahead of them and hell behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.05,0:25:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.55,0:25:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, escape this deadly trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.35,0:25:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Point of No Return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.31,0:25:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 298 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:37.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Only the future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:53.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Has the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:59.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:14.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Memory only strikes at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:25.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The heart to find
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The truth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:37.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}Do not forget it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:45.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Many stars lie beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:53.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}The spiral of memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:24:06.47,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sparkling in what looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:13.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}The light of memory
